  "description": "Applies Majorsilence.Forms CSS themes to native Avalonia controls — one stylesheet restyles Avalonia views, Majorsilence.Forms surfaces and (with Majorsilence.Forms.Theming.WinForms) real WinForms. Writes Fluent theme resources and a generated Styles object, publishes the stylesheet's tokens and variables as named resources for your own views, and reports what Avalonia cannot express as diagnostics instead of silently ignoring it.",
